@startuml
title UC3 — SO10 cancelReferral (CO10, Iteration I p. 13)
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
actor "Healthcare Professional" as HP
participant "rc:ReferralController" as RC <<controller>>
note over HP, RC
  Preconditions: successful SO08; unfinished UC3 context.
  No Referral has been recorded for this invocation.
end note
HP -> RC : cancelReferral()
activate RC
RC -> RC : clearReferralContext()
note right of RC
  Drop current patient/issuer references and unsaved input.
  No domain delete or status-change message is sent.
  Earlier ActivityRecords and existing Referrals remain.
  No cancellation audit is required by CO10.
end note
deactivate RC
@enduml
